    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79420" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεξ-ελαύνω</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα,
			ἵππους</span>, etc.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drive past, pass</i> in a race, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.344
			</span></i> ; <i>row past</i>, c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὴν
				δὴ τάς γε</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σειρῆνας</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
			παρεξελάσωσιν</span> (or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὲξ ἐ-</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἑταῖροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.55
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>march by</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.126
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππῳ π</span>. <i>ride
			past</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
